//       and it is verified: the disk write lives a level up, in ZoneMapContent::saveLevelData 0x36DCA0.
//   (d) THE SIGNATURE CANNOT BE ESTABLISHED FROM WHAT IS IN HAND. It takes five arguments; the decompile of
